1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:04,893
Hate budgeting? Try the simplest budget there is. Fifty, thirty, twenty.

2
00:00:05,243 --> 00:00:09,723
Fifty percent goes to needs. Rent, bills, groceries, and getting to work.

3
00:00:10,073 --> 00:00:13,894
Thirty percent is for wants. Eating out, hobbies, streaming, trips.

4
00:00:14,244 --> 00:00:18,981
And twenty percent goes to future you. Savings, investing, and paying off debt.

5
00:00:19,331 --> 00:00:24,561
On three thousand a month after tax, that's fifteen hundred, nine hundred, and six hundred.

6
00:00:24,911 --> 00:00:30,460
If rent eats more than half, that's normal in a lot of cities. Adjust the numbers, keep the idea.

7
00:00:30,810 --> 00:00:35,048
The point is simple. Every dollar gets a job before the month starts.
